      "message": "These comments don\u0027t mention anything about the effect of changing these. I suspect that this is related to splitting SRAM into code part and data part, if it\u0027s true, why it\u0027s different from [what we have in EC](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/baseboard/helipilot/base_board.h;l\u003d65-79;drc\u003d278a8174859eebd57f05fd04397a09ecfa317ee1)?",
